  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the oven to 300 degrees Fahrenheit.",
    "Season the lamb shoulder with salt and pepper.",
    "Heat the olive oil in a large Dutch oven over medium heat.",
    "Sear the lamb shoulder until browned on all sides.",
    "Add the chopped onion to the pot and cook until softened.",
    "Add the minced garlic and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the crushed tomatoes, lamb stock, and browned lamb shoulder to the pot.",
    "Cover the pot and transfer to the preheated oven.",
    "Braise the lamb for 2 1/2 hours, or until tender.",
    "Shred the cooked lamb and mix with the mashed yellow potato.",
    "Top the lamb and potato mixture with diced avocado and chopped cilantro."
